      "writtenOn": "2023-03-14T01:02:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK，the 5.2% regression detail data is as below (ns),thank you~\n\n```\nsyscall\t before     after      Diff       Diff(%)\nread\t   3672.9221   3482.1913  -190.7308   -5.2%\n```\n-\u003e Test code snapshot\n\n```\n\nstatic long long unsigned syscallRead(int times){\n    struct timespec ts;\n    char buf[512];\n    int fd, i;\n    long long unsigned start_ns, end_ns;\n    long long unsigned delta;\n    long long unsigned sum_time_spent \u003d 0;\n    memset(buf, \u0027*\u0027, SIZE);\n    fd \u003d open(\"testfile\", O_RDWR | O_CREAT, 0700);\n    write(fd, buf, SIZE);\n    for(i\u003d0; i \u003c times; i++){\n        lseek(fd, 0, SEEK_SET);\n        start_ns \u003d time_ns(\u0026ts);\n        read(fd, buf, SIZE);\n        end_ns \u003d time_ns(\u0026ts);\n        sum_time_spent +\u003d (end_ns - start_ns);\n        usleep(DELAY_TIME);\n    }\n    close(fd);\n    printf(\"[%s] loop:%d time elapsed: %lluns\\n\", __func__, times, sum_time_spent);\n    return sum_time_spent;\n}\n\n```\n\n-\u003e Test step\n```\n1. install syscallMea case\n2. fix highest_freq\n3. run test case\n   taskset 08 ./syscallMea -b read -t 10000\n4. get test data, for example not included the patch data:\n   build-in arg:read\n   test times:10000\n   case:read\n   [syscallRead] loop:10000 time elapsed: 36729221ns\n   num cmd:1 times:10000 avg time elapsed: 3672.9221 nano seconds\n```",
